course: dictionary
lesson: 14752
title: Propelling: pushing forward
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Propelling means pushing or driving something forward. When you read it, ask: what is being pushed, and where is it going? «The oars were propelling the little boat across the lake.» The oars push the water backwards, and the boat moves forward. That is what propelling means.
explain: Propelling can also describe a person. «Fear was propelling him on.» Fear did not push him with hands. It drove him to keep going, so propelling here means making someone move or act.
explain: Propelling is also an adjective in «propelling pencil». A propelling pencil pushes out its lead when you twist or click it. Look at the words around the word to tell which meaning the writer means.
fact: Propelling comes from the verb propel, which means to push or drive forward.
fact: The forms of propel are propel, propels, propelled and propelling.
fact: «Propelling» means pushing or driving something forward.
fact: «A propelling pencil» is a pencil where the lead is pushed out by twisting or clicking.
fact: In science, engines, oars, wings and jets of water can all propel a boat, a plane or a squid.
exercise: «The oars were propelling the little boat forward.» What were the oars doing? | Sinking the boat | *Pushing the boat forward | Stopping the boat | Painting the boat
exercise: Ben says a propelling pencil is a pencil you sharpen with a knife. What is a propelling pencil? | A pencil that is painted gold | *A pencil where you twist or click to push out the lead | A pencil you sharpen with a knife
exercise: «Fear was propelling him on.» What does propelling mean here? | Making him stop | Making him sleep | Making him sit down | *Making him keep going
test: The squid was propelling itself through the water with a jet of water. What was the squid doing? | Sitting still on the sea floor | Floating up to the surface and staying there | Sinking to the bottom | *Pushing itself forward with a jet of water
test: Which word is in the same family as propel? | Green | *Propelled | Silent | Sleeping
exam: Mia clicks her propelling pencil to push out more lead. What kind of pencil is a propelling pencil? | A pencil that is painted gold | A pencil that writes only in ink | A pencil you sharpen with a knife | *A pencil whose lead is pushed out by twisting or clicking
